Some skills under skills/ are copies of skills maintained in other repositories.
Each such directory carries a .source.json naming the repository, path, commit and
licence it came from; skills.yaml pins the same four, and
tools/sync_external.py --check re-verifies the copy against that commit. The bytes
are upstream's, except where .source.json records a file as modified — in which case
the file itself says so and states why.

